<title>CANADA: CWB durum revs up 3.4 pct at C$1.1 bln in 1995/96.</title>
<headline>CWB durum revs up 3.4 pct at C$1.1 bln in 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board on Wednesday said its durum wheat pool account revenues rose 3.4 percent to C$1.13 billion in crop year 1995/96 (Aug/July) versus C$1.09 billion the prior year, the CWB's annual report shows.</p>
<p>			    1995/96			 1994/95</p>
<p> Revs		$1,130,364,370	   $1,093,295,512</p>
<p> Revs/Tonne		$284.484		   $268.748</p>
<p> Tonnes sold	    3,973,384		  4,068,116</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
